flowchart TB
    IN["SENSORY INPUTS<br/>Issues · PRs · code · providers · runtime"] --> ATT["ATTENTION & SALIENCE<br/>Triage · watchers · interrupts"]
    ATT --> MEM["MEMORY & KNOWLEDGE<br/>Context graph · corpus · registries"]
    MEM --> EXE["EXECUTIVE CONTROL<br/>Manager · goals · plans · constraints"]
    EXE --> SEL["ACTION SELECTION<br/>Eligibility · admission · routing"]
    SEL --> ACT["ACTION & INTEGRATION<br/>Agents · adapters · Termux · GitHub Actions"]
    ACT --> EVD["EVIDENCE & HOMEOSTASIS<br/>SHE · ATES · 3L0 · security · resources"]
    EVD --> FB["FEEDBACK & LEARNING<br/>Validate · compare · classify · record"]
    FB --> EXE

    EXE <--> COORD["INTEGRATION FABRIC<br/>Shared events · handoffs · evidence envelopes"]
    MEM <--> COORD
    ACT <--> COORD
    EVD --> SAFE["AUTHORITY & PROTECTION<br/>Permissions · secret boundaries · stop conditions"]
    SAFE -. constrains .-> SEL
    SAFE -. constrains .-> ACT

    subgraph FUTURE["PROPOSED EVOLUTION LANES"]
      DMN["Dreamforge<br/>Offline synthesis"]
      NOV["Novelty / weak-signal detection"]
      CONS["Context consolidation"]
      PLAST["Plasticity governor<br/>Controlled policy adaptation"]
    end
    FB -. evidence only .-> DMN
    FB -. evidence only .-> NOV
    DMN -. reviewed proposals .-> EXE
    NOV -. reviewed alerts .-> ATT
    MEM -. reversible summaries .-> CONS
    CONS -. source-linked updates .-> MEM
    FB -. bounded experiments .-> PLAST
    PLAST -. approved policy version .-> SEL

